{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/2eaa96a4e1b01b95bf5b15327167a4b2.avif?t=1764017368\" width=571 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dream big. Shoot bigger.</strong> Zaxtron EXPLUS is a turbo\u2011charged, score\u2011chasing arcade shmup set inside a kid\u2019s late\u2011night dream. Choose from 6 weapons (each with an alt\u2011fire), melt screen\u2011filling bosses, and chase multipliers across Normal, Hard, Boss Rush, and the bonus <strong>Space Monsters</strong> mode\u2014a love letter to classic \u201980s Space Invaders\u2014pulsing with a soundtrack by <strong>Filippo Game Audio</strong> <i>(Vampire Survivors, Hill Climb Racing, LEGO\u00ae Hill Climb Adventures)</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/cd873b0a4720085e7c0ff104f132ccf2.poster.avif?t=1764017368\" width=29 height=47 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/cd873b0a4720085e7c0ff104f132ccf2.webm?t=1764017368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0<strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s the weekend. Sammy sneaks in \u201cone more run\u201d on the AGES Master Drive after everyone\u2019s asleep\u2026 and drifts off mid\u2011game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to his dream\u2014where he\u2019s strapped into a jetpac <strong>inside</strong> the cartridge, dodging neon bullet curtains and blasting anything that moves. <strong>Zaxtron EXPLUS</strong> blends chunky retro charm with modern shmup intensity for that perfect <i>just\u2011one\u2011more\u2011credit</i> hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/cd873b0a4720085e7c0ff104f132ccf2.poster.avif?t=1764017368\" width=29 height=47 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/cd873b0a4720085e7c0ff104f132ccf2.webm?t=1764017368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0<strong>Why You\u2019ll Love It</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six Ways to Wreck:</strong> Pick from <strong>6 distinct weapons</strong>, each with a satisfying <strong>alternate fire</strong> to carve lanes, erase swarms, or crack boss armor when the screen gets spicy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modes for Any Mood:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode</strong> \u2013 learn patterns, build confidence, and rack up medals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode 99HP -</strong>\u00a0practice your runs and learn bullet patterns with a chunky 99HP to spend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard Mode</strong> \u2013 denser bullet curtains and razor\u2011thin dodges for score fiends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Rush</strong> \u2013 a non\u2011stop gauntlet of dream lords like <strong>Cloudy Boy</strong>, <strong>Squid King</strong>, <strong>Tank King</strong>, <strong>Battleship</strong>, <strong>Volcano Russo</strong>, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Monsters</strong> \u2013 a bonus, pick\u2011up\u2011and\u2011play tribute to the purest form of arcade bliss: classic <strong>Space Invaders</strong> vibes with modern snap.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score Chaser\u2019s Playground:</strong> Pump your <strong>multiplier</strong>, scoop <strong>medals</strong>, time your <strong>bombs</strong>, and master routes through zones like the <strong>Nature Reserve</strong>, <strong>Htoh Region</strong>, and <strong>Military Base</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Look, Modern Feel:</strong> Crisp pixel art, screen\u2011filling patterns, punchy hits, and quick restarts keep the adrenaline flowing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn It Up:</strong> A soundtrack by <strong>Filippo Game Audio</strong> <i>(Vampire Survivors, Hill Climb Racing, LEGO\u00ae Hill Climb Adventures)</i> supercharges every dodge  with thumping, unforgettable hooks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Whether you grew up chasing high scores or you\u2019re discovering shmups for the first time, <strong>Zaxtron EXPLUS</strong> is built for instant fun and deep mastery. </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strap on the jetpac, boost through the dream, and show Sammy how it\u2019s done!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/b3e71521c3d5b30494682dd6cf86b62b.avif?t=1764017368\" width=189 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/7e061b2cd22e15a653a7f454135fc482.apng?t=1764017368\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/7e061b2cd22e15a653a7f454135fc482.poster.avif?t=1764017368\" class=\"bb_img\" width=57 height=98 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst