assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/7e061b2cd22e15a653a7f454135fc482.apng?t=1764017368\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/7e061b2cd22e15a653a7f454135fc482.poster.avif?t=1764017368\" class=\"bb_img\" width=57 height=98 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/7e061b2cd22e15a653a7f454135fc482.apng?t=1764017368\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/7e061b2cd22e15a653a7f454135fc482.poster.avif?t=1764017368\" class=\"bb_img\" width=57 height=98 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/7e061b2cd22e15a653a7f454135fc482.apng?t=1764017368\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/7e061b2cd22e15a653a7f454135fc482.poster.avif?t=1764017368\" class=\"bb_img\" width=57 height=98 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/7e061b2cd22e15a653a7f454135fc482.apng?t=1764017368\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/7e061b2cd22e15a653a7f454135fc482.poster.avif?t=1764017368\" class=\"bb_img\" width=57 height=98 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planned Updates \u2013 Year One Roadmap</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are committed to expanding the game with free major updates in the first year after launch. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned content includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard Mode Boss Rush</strong> \u2013 face every boss in their hard mode variant back-to-back with no room for error.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonus Game</strong> \u2013 an entirely new extra mode for players who want variety beyond the main campaign.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Additional Stages</strong> \u2013 expanding the core game with new levels, enemies, and patterns.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXTREME Mode</strong> \u2013 the ultimate test of skill, designed for expert STG players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of these updates will be added progressively over the first year after release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806110?t=1764017368","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/17e39653bdaafe3fb8f22a2ca48cd9e958e15d7a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764017368","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/0c14ca881063f5540197752032a1c04a4849019d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764017368","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/0c14ca881063f5540197752032a1c04a4849019d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764017368","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/2eaa96a4e1b01b95bf5b15327167a4b2.avif?t=1764017368\" width=571 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dream big. Shoot bigger.</strong> Zaxtron EXPLUS is a turbo\u2011charged, score\u2011chasing arcade shmup set inside a kid\u2019s late\u2011night dream. Choose from 6 weapons (each with an alt\u2011fire), melt screen\u2011filling bosses, and chase multipliers across Normal, Hard, Boss Rush, and the bonus <strong>Space Monsters</strong> mode\u2014a love letter to classic \u201980s Space Invaders\u2014pulsing with a soundtrack by <strong>Filippo Game Audio</strong> <i>(Vampire Survivors, Hill Climb Racing, LEGO\u00ae Hill Climb Adventures)</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/cd873b0a4720085e7c0ff104f132ccf2.poster.avif?t=1764017368\" width=29 height=47 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/cd873b0a4720085e7c0ff104f132ccf2.webm?t=1764017368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0<strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s the weekend. Sammy sneaks in \u201cone more run\u201d on the AGES Master Drive after everyone\u2019s asleep\u2026 and drifts off mid\u2011game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to his dream\u2014where he\u2019s strapped into a jetpac <strong>inside</strong> the cartridge, dodging neon bullet curtains and blasting anything that moves. <strong>Zaxtron EXPLUS</strong> blends chunky retro charm with modern shmup intensity for that perfect <i>just\u2011one\u2011more\u2011credit</i> hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/cd873b0a4720085e7c0ff104f132ccf2.poster.avif?t=1764017368\" width=29 height=47 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/cd873b0a4720085e7c0ff104f132ccf2.webm?t=1764017368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\